  <h3>Cosori Dehydrator Beef Jerky</h3>
  <p>The Cosori CP267 is one of the most popular jerky dehydrators, and it makes excellent beef jerky at its 165°F setting. Because Cosori units run a strong rear fan, they dry slightly faster than the 160°F baseline — start the bend test at <strong>3.5–4 hours</strong> rather than 4. Use the six stainless trays with space between strips, and rotate the top and bottom trays once at the halfway mark for the most even results. The 165°F max also satisfies the USDA 160°F safety threshold without a separate oven step.</p>

